doc:FactsArticle1_2 schema1:abstract "Ocean shipping is the backbone of international trade contributing to global economic growth. Consequently, ensuring that ships operate in an energy-efficient manner is crucial to a more sustainable global transportation. Engine failures can lead to severe consequences including compromised safety, operational disruptions, and substantial economic losses. The proposed research integrates marine diesel engines diagnostics with multivariate machine learning algorithms to develop an advanced proactive maintenance strategy to anticipate engine performance trends and proactively identify potential faults before they escalate." .
_:ece86ac6dcaf1de6820ff6a1c269b4de rdf:reifies <<( doc:FactsArticle1_2 schema1:abstract "Ocean shipping is the backbone of international trade contributing to global economic growth. Consequently, ensuring that ships operate in an energy-efficient manner is crucial to a more sustainable global transportation. Engine failures can lead to severe consequences including compromised safety, operational disruptions, and substantial economic losses. The proposed research integrates marine diesel engines diagnostics with multivariate machine learning algorithms to develop an advanced proactive maintenance strategy to anticipate engine performance trends and proactively identify potential faults before they escalate." )>> ;
